Faded Thai Ghost Film (หนังผีไทยฟิล์มซีด) — "มุ้งขาว · The White Net" (demo film of the user's own style)
Every asset in the film, with its source and licence.

STORY AND PEOPLE
- An invented scene. The woman and the figure in the net are original, generated for this demo; they resemble
  no real person. No real legend, place or event is depicted.

IMAGES (ChatGPT image generation, OpenAI)
- These images belong to this demo only; a film in this style generates its own images for its own story.
- img/house.png (house-night), img/woman.png (woman-green, keyed by tools/key.py), img/house-ghost.png
  (house-ghost, an edit of house-night in the same chat, used only inside img/ghost-mask.png).
  Generated with ChatGPT image generation (OpenAI) for this film; prompts in images.json and images.log.json.

